e and aberrant..i been thinking how to piece a setting on the Venture Bros universe. taking the teragen and making the League of Calamitous Intent, and the directive as OSI. any suggestions?</div> </div> </div> </div>Though i'm first to admit i as less familiar with Venture Bros than i should, from what i have seen and remember if would say most of it is closer to Adventure with some spandex than the four color with shades of transhuman grey of Aberrant, more Planetary than Authority, so to speak.<br /> <br /> Adventure on itself might be malleable enough for your needs, specially if you as ST lets PCs or NPCs with Ability Mastery of all types, not just the scientific, develop Innovations and Inventions for gimmicks/devices associated with their Mastered ability. Things like mind-controlling/death-dealing harmonics/music (Perform), revolutionary diet-exercise problems that make unaging supersoldiers out of weaklings (Endurance/Might), wall-shattering fighting moves (brawl, martial arts) and other deliciously pulpy stuff possible through this minor tweak of Adventure's rules should be of much help in closing that distance.<br /> <br /> Hope this helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T23:50:34-07:00","id":186900,"title":"","content":"yeah.. Adventure fits the &quot;Pulpy&quot; feel of Venture Bros. pretty well.. to use Aberrant.. it would be a pretty low level game..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2164-mistershifter","name":"MisterShifter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T13:01:24-07:00","id":228399,"title":"","content":"Note that the soundtrack for Venture Bros makes an excellent fit for intense or high action Adventure! games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-23T07:49:03-07:00","id":238189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MisterShifter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/184249-adventure-aberrant-venture-bros?p=186900#post186900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">yeah.. Adventure fits the &quot;Pulpy&quot; feel of Venture Bros. pretty well.. to use Aberrant.. it would be a pretty low level game..</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on how one plays the &quot;raw power vs versatility&quot; angle, it could look low-level while allowing for characters with considerable experience. But yeah, probably little to no mega-ST above 2 or damage-dealing stuff beyond 15-20s without going &quot;death machine/mad science wonder of the episode&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}